2. Permitted academic use

Subject to these terms and any applicable third-party obligations, you may
use, reproduce and modify the covered materials solely for non-commercial
academic research, academic evaluation and teaching. For these purposes you
may run, study, evaluate and fine-tune covered model weights.

You may share covered materials and modifications for those same permitted
purposes if you include this complete license, preserve applicable copyright
and attribution notices, identify modifications and their authors, and do not
grant recipients broader rights in the covered materials than this license
